Subject: [PATCH v4 02/12] kexec: Extract kexec_free_segment_cma() from kimage_free_cma()
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 20:53:54 +0800
Message-ID: <20260907125404.922123-3-ruanjinjie@huawei.com>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.34.1
